{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Begin as a fresh-faced 18 year old, with the world at your feet, and create your very own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast fantasy world... (The game uses a multi map system, featuring ancient Norsca, Albion, Araby, and the icy world of the Frost Giants)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and combat skills, maybe even learn dark magics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a fearsome crew of fellow raiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot ancient ruins, and discover the secret lairs of terrifying enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marry and create a mighty dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade and enjoy vast wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play politics and become a Jarl, or maybe even King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home village into a thriving city, envy of the ancient world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you sit at Odin's right hand in Valhol, or be consigned to wander the shadows of Helheim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail... You can begin again where your last hero fell, as  one of his sons, or one of his loyal fellow raiders...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927200?t=1754549723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927200/70b4e787aea58d0fc077cc5f15ca4fd9420ec45d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754549723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927200/a5a5a631a8e8b63f1b69bb632c2426166470439b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754549723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927200/a5a5a631a8e8b63f1b69bb632c2426166470439b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754549723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Begin as a fresh-faced 18 year old, with the world at your feet, and create your very own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast fantasy world... (The game uses a multi map system, featuring ancient Norsca, Albion, Araby, and the icy world of the Frost Giants)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and combat skills, maybe even learn dark magics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a fearsome crew of fellow raiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot ancient ruins, and discover the secret lairs of terrifying enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marry and create a mighty dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade and enjoy vast wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play politics and become a Jarl, or maybe even King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home village into a thriving city, envy of the ancient world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you sit at Odin's right hand in Valhol, or be consigned to wander the shadows of Helheim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail... You can begin again where your last hero fell, as  one of his sons, or one of his loyal fellow raiders...</p>","developers":["MDH Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927200/0c3277569be44ff2d63bf284b8b4b519ac54b48e/header.jpg?t=1754549723","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) MDH Software, 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><